        "collapse_shipping": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>How fast is shipping?</p>",
            "content": "<p>We dispatch all orders same day from Dubai. <strong>Dubai:</strong> same-day delivery with a 4-hour option before the cut-off. <strong>UAE:</strong> next-day delivery. <strong>International:</strong> DHL Express, typically 4\u20136 business days depending on region.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/shipping-and-returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Shipping & Returns Policy\">Shipping policy</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"/pages/help-faq#track\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Track Order\">Track your order</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_coa": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>How do I verify a COA?</p>",
            "content": "<p>We have decided on third-party testing for all new batches moving forward. To find a COA, browse the <a href=\"/pages/quality-coa-library\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"COA Library\">COA Library</a>, or scan the QR code on your product to open its product page, where the most recent COA is listed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_peptides": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Do you ship peptides internationally?</p>",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we ship peptides worldwide via DHL Express from Dubai. Delivery is typically 4\u20136 business days, though customs processing can add time in some countries. Import rules vary by destination; we cannot provide legal advice on local regulations.</p><p>If an order fails delivery, we refund it. See our <a href=\"/pages/help-faq\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FAQ\">full FAQ</a> for more on international shipping.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_free_shipping": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Is shipping free?</p>",
            "content": "<p>Express shipping is free on all orders over <strong>AED 300</strong> (or the equivalent in USD).</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_stacks": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Stacks vs single ingredients?</p>",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"/collections/stacks\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Stacks\">Pre-built stacks</a> pair complementary ingredients for a specific goal (focus, calm, memory, or energy) so you spend less time researching pairings. Single ingredients give you full control to build your own stack one compound at a time. Many beginners start with a stack, then swap individual ingredients as they learn their response.</p>"
          }
        }
